Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,POCO, WHERE YOU 'VE BEEN?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,HOW DARE YOU LEAVE THE HOUSE LIKE THIS?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, I'm sorry I left the\Nhouse, but where's my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, where do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?! No, Papa! Don't see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me she didn't go out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,POCO, what's ailing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not behaving right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister! I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.07,0:00:50.20,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora! Koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.07,0:00:50.20,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Two stars fall from the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.07,0:00:50.20,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.28,0:00:57.87,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikari to yami no minamo suikomareteyuku
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.28,0:00:57.87,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One shining in the light, the other sinking into darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.29,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikiau you ni kasanaru hamon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.29,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,A ripple drawing the two of them together
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.71,0:01:14.35,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyo no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.71,0:01:14.35,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of pride and receive the sun's guidance
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.71,0:01:14.35,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyou no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.35,0:01:20.48,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yabou no hate wo mezasu mono ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.35,0:01:20.48,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of unbridled ambition...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.89,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.89,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Demanding sacrifice!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.48,0:01:21.89,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.73,0:01:32.61,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.73,0:01:32.61,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.61,0:01:35.95,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono te kara hanate kodou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.61,0:01:35.95,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Strike down your fears,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.95,0:01:39.41,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.95,0:01:39.41,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.95,0:01:39.41,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.41,0:01:46.09,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.41,0:01:46.09,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot overcome your pain unless you can accept...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.41,0:01:46.09,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayou naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.09,0:01:50.09,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.09,0:01:50.09,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.09,0:01:50.09,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.09,0:01:53.89,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.09,0:01:53.89,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:02:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.90,0:02:11.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs74\fad(900,850)\pos(1160,830)\bord3.5\blur2}Episode 8: "JoJo & Dio's Bloody Battle!"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.90,0:02:11.99,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs74\fad(900,850)\pos(1160,830)}Episode 8: "Jojo & Dio's Bloody Battle!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Examine this rose in\Nbloom for but a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vibrant, fresh, and young, what\Nyou see is a mirror of your youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this fact\Ncarefully, Mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the first moment this flower\Nfully blooms, it begins to wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shame, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only sixteen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sweet, so innocent and pure now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So full of delicious life\Nenergy, wonderful Lord Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those lacking in manners\Nare not fit to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Mademoiselle, I\Noffer unto you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you not care to enjoy your\Nyouth and beauty for all eternity?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fret not, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall not force my friendship\Nupon you like others might do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You control your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hold your destiny in your own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fiend. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wear the flesh, but you're not a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, although your acquaintance will\Nbe brief, let me introduce my companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I present unto you, Doobie, as\Nregrettably I am not to your taste,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enjoy your time with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Au River, mademoiselle.
