Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your kind don't deserve any introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister! Pukul!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:04:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bitchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:05:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bitch on your bright little face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he got under there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His mask! Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.96,0:05:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's chock-a-block with\Nserpents! All sorts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Venomous cobras,\Nflesh-eating asps and vipers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bit surprised, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sank their fangs in his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more than just once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How wearisome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't the time to deal with\Nany more of Dio's foolish games!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He squeezed out the poison. Good control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's learnt a great deal about blood\Nflow in a very short amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's helping our boy after giving\NJonathan his life energy when he died!
