Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use a bit of the\Ngreat hormone I possess
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to turn these serpents\Nback on their master!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooker! Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who survived his time in hell, Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.48,0:06:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are alive, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logically, that would then indicate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have killed my two knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We await your order to reduce him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into a pile of bloody flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord, let my fangs make\Nan impression on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this one is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He falls by my hand alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand me, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, this is something in\Nwhich I will take no pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were raised in the same house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the prospect of turning\Nyou into an United thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is not a happy one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted you to be\Nquickly dispatched by my knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it would seem, in the\Nend, I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing you here, alive, brings me to\Nthe realization that as an emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was being far too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I'll put you to death without\Na moment's thought or compunction!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could say the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will feel no hint of\Nguilt for your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first I have a question, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happened to that\Nmustachioed charlatan of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to have lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shames me as a gentleman to say this,\Nbut I can no longer hold back the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.32,0:08:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Jonathan Joestar,\Nhave such hatred for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vengeance consumes me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, please step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a prior claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my right to avenge\Nmy friend's killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli was a brave man and boon companion\Nthrough two decades of harsh training.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dia, for his life, I shall now send\Nyou to the bowels of hell itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, Dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, D .O.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has hidden abilities for\Nwhich you are not prepared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an interesting walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, with decades\Nof the proper training,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mere humans can enable themselves\Nto float through the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in only a single night, I attained\Npower far surpassing that of any human guru!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly think you can\Ndefeat me in this manner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you were sleepwalking?
