Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He froze Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio must have somehow chilled all\Nthe moisture in his body at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turning him to ice in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio can't control his hormone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't send it into Dio\Nunless his blood is flowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Struth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Dio's a fearsome\Ncreature right enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He froze Dio's whole body at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we are feeble, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You imbecile, you dare think\Nyou could lay a finger on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's going to give\Nup your life like some mongrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's endeavor to give them\Na good show, shall we? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, stop it now!
