Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those hormone-filled roses\Nthorns do sting a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insect, how dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you wound me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wound my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dyer, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed wagon! My sword! Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how to deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dyer gave up his life, which showed\Nme just how vulnerable you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be very easy for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is fill Bluford's\NSword of Luck and Pluck with Hamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and slice you with it!
