Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to touch me, filthy human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to touch me with your Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More disgusting than frog urine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your string of luck's run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you shall be father for my zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will gnaw the faces\Nright off your skulls!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shows his true colors as someone\Nfit only to rule over a dung heap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.76,0:12:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His cool, taut sophistication,\Nnothing but a cheap mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that he's had himself a nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humiliating taste of Hamon, he\Nreveals his true, filthy self!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzoe's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Page would be my name. Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Born on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needle vein strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roses are alive and vital!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So harmon will remain inside them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flowing along with their life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the same thing\Ncannot be said for steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's necessary to make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great many of them are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wish, I shall handle them for you.
