Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will squeeze the life out\Nof you with my own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will cleanse the world\Nof your evil influence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He snatched up some roses\Nwhen I wasn't looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He circled around to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio is blind on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this, Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows exactly what he's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He finally defeated Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeated you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so feeble, Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now weakling, you shall join\Nmy other children of the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your rubbery little\Nbaby between my fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So warm and springy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strangely pleasant feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoying this anguished Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One tiny little move and\Nthis delicate blood vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,snaps in two like a wet ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your carotid open, all\Nyour blood will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I shall fill the vacancy\Nwith my own Vampiric Essence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you will be my thrall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zombies, to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep those peasants back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.04,0:16:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rather busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing seems to stem\Nthis tide of zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot provide any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Shuichi, in your last moment of free\Nwill, realize that the victory was mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've not won yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made a fatal mistake? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you freeze me completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll not be able to continue\Nfeeding on my life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means however that\Nmy hormone is unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't block it as long as\NI remain partially unfrozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tactics to say the\Nleast are somewhat blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long has the sword\Nbeen in those flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The metal blade is conducting\Nheat from the fire faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that I can freeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon is blowing up the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunlight yellow, overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite evident the Hamon\Ndid not make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arm, my arm is frozen solid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only briefly touched his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't over, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, I must\Nadmire your tenaciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.06,0:17:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your ingenious use of the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly marvelous example of quick thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But really, Jojo, an emperor's\Nreach should exceed his grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a touch on the arm is all it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can turn your whole body\Nto ice in two seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vampire essence!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He squeezed it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The let's do battle stance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how you prepare, Human\Nability is extremely limited and finite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Harmon training avails you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mere monkey can never defeat a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In comparison to my power, you\Nare but a mere monkey, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With true conviction, the human\Nrace can overcome anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me demonstrate to just what\Nheights a human being can rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time, a\Nzombie is all you'll ever be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Struth, his hand is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flames coming from his glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might just have the power\Nto get through Dio's ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this business is done,\Nwhich one of us will have fallen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find out, Dio!
