Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm disintegrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain, the burning, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:19:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My reign was to have lasted forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for centuries uncounted by man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to be destroyed, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he shoot energy from out of his\Neye? He came to within only mere inches of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,incinerating my brain\Nfar too close the last
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,act the demon refuses to\Nacknowledge his death?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio has fallen from the parapet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:20:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he fainted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's worn out. Too right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been in more fatal fights tonight\Nthan a man should have in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would he shed tears\Nfor an evil creature like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He weeps because they\Nspent their youth together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio was like a brother to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for me, I could sing a song of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.44,0:21:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli, were you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may sound an exaggeration,\Nbut JoJo saved the world tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.05,0:22:08.56,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.56,0:22:12.10,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent the day in your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.10,0:22:17.36,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,We spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling morning, running through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.36,0:22:19.94,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in another valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.94,0:22:23.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and out the valley... hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.12,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart's coming out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.37,0:22:29.41,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.41,0:22:31.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.42,0:22:38.09,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.71,0:22:44.26,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.05,0:22:50.72,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.72,0:22:54.69,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.72,0:22:54.69,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,there with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,da, da, da, da, da,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,da,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,da,
